                                                "example_id": "66d5e624-070b-4b94-8632-98476e485719",
                                                "sense_id": "41ca96ee-dca9-3f8a-893c-222eefe9de92",
                                                "text": "The solitary, lumbering trolls of Scandinavian mythology would sometimes be turned to stone by exposure to sunlight. Barack Obama is hoping that several measures announced on June 4th will have a similarly paralysing effect on their modern incarnation, the patent troll."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "156fb017-0a4f-49b1-999d-9103ff11e54c",
                                                "sense_id": "41ca96ee-dca9-3f8a-893c-222eefe9de92",
                                                "text": "Instead of using unpolarized sunlight as my light source and then filtering it with a polarizer, I can just use my screen as a source of polarized light."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
